&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of federal and state procedural/discovery rules, and relevant case law&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management experience with ability to handle multiple matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional analytical and communication skills that work for both Legal and Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of complex data infrastructure, data analytics, and industry best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
