&lt;li&gt;Advance Discord’s patent program with targeted strategies for key technology domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with in-house and outside counsel and cross-functional partners on patent licensing, including hands-on drafting and negotiations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
